type utility which provides the name of the SymbolFlag for a given
numerical representation of it's `ts.SymbolFlags` property.

```ts
// 384
type Enum = ts.SymbolFlags.Enum;
// "Enum"
type AndBack = SymbolFlagLookup<Enum>
```

